{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 107,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9842529296875,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "(less with version 2.0, although very limited data) and hence require repeat or additional testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.945012092590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.015625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "However, if the same test were to be applied to the testing of smear-negative sputum specimens",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        527.0921020507812,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "from patients without confirmed TB or DR-TB (i.e. patients suspected of having DR-TB), the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9655151367188,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "indeterminate rate for the test would be significantly higher. Given the test’s sensitivity and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9688720703125,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "specificity when an SL-LPA is done directly on sputum, the GDG felt that SL-LPAs can be used",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        527.2012329101562,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "for the testing of all sputum specimens from patients with confirmed MDR/RR-TB, irrespective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996649742126465,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        343.5515441894531,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "of whether the microscopy result is positive or negative.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        526.9963989257812,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "For the reasons mentioned above (inadequate data owing to too few studies on version 2.0),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        526.9646606445312,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "results are not presented here for version 2.0. For MTBDR version 2.0, the data were either  sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        527.0030517578125,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "too sparse or too heterogeneous to combine in a meta-analysis or to compare indirect and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.66522216796875,
        138.11940002441406,
        245.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "direct testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.66912841796875,
        526.9640502929688,
        269.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "Three studies evaluated the MTBDR version 2.0 in 562 individuals, including 111 confirmed  sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.16912841796875,
        526.96484375,
        285.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "cases of TB with fluoroquinolone resistance by indirect testing on a culture of  M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.66912841796875,
        526.68408203125,
        300.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "compared with a phenotypic culture-based DST reference standard. Estimates of sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.16912841796875,
        374.538818359375,
        316.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "ranged from 84% to 100% and specificity from 99% to 100%.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.1730041503906,
        526.964111328125,
        340.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "See   for details of the  Web Annex B.15: Drug concentrations used in culture-based DST SL-LPA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.6730041503906,
        527.325439453125,
        355.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "drug concentrations used in culture-based DST to evaluate the performance of SL-LPAs in each",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.981134414672852,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1730041503906,
        145.23631286621094,
        371.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "included study.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.68463134765625,
        275.1541442871094,
        400.0646057128906
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.8155212402344,
        526.964599609375,
        421.9605407714844
      ],
      "text": "The SL-LPA should only be used to test specimens from patients with confirmed MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.8155212402344,
        526.9479370117188,
        435.9605407714844
      ],
      "text": "Adoption of SL-LPAs does not eliminate the need for conventional culture and DST capability.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.8155212402344,
        526.8284912109375,
        449.9605407714844
      ],
      "text": "Despite good specificity of SL-LPAs for the detection of resistance to fluoroquinolones and the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993348121643066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.8155212402344,
        527.0140380859375,
        463.9605407714844
      ],
      "text": "SLIDs, culture and phenotypic DST is required to completely exclude resistance to these drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.8155212402344,
        524.3892211914062,
        477.9605407714844
      ],
      "text": "classes as well as to other second-line drugs. The following implementation considerations apply:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.5675048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        497.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        484.5675048828125,
        526.9641723632812,
        497.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "SL-LPAs cannot determine resistance to individual drugs in the class of fluoroquinolones.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        500.0675048828125,
        527.2659912109375,
        513.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "Resistance-conferring mutations detected by SL-LPAs are highly correlated with phenotypic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.981634140014648,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        515.5675048828125,
        279.62689208984375,
        528.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "resistance to ofloxacin and levofloxacin.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.0675048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        544.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        531.0675048828125,
        526.9647827148438,
        544.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "Mutations in some regions (e.g. the  promoter region) may be responsible for causing  eis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        546.5675048828125,
        526.9093017578125,
        559.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "resistance to one drug in a class more than other drugs within that class. For example, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        562.0675048828125,
        520.9077758789062,
        575.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "C14T mutation is associated with kanamycin resistance in strains from Eastern Europe. eis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.5675048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        590.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        577.5675048828125,
        526.9644165039062,
        590.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "SL-LPAs should be used in the direct testing of sputum specimens, irrespective of whether",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        593.0675048828125,
        309.1617126464844,
        606.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "samples are smear negative or smear positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.5675048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        621.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        608.5675048828125,
        526.7518310546875,
        621.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "SL-LPAs are designed to detect TB and resistance to fluroquinolones and SLIDs from sputum",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978379249572754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        624.0675048828125,
        526.953857421875,
        637.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "samples. Other respiratory samples (e.g. BAL and gastric aspirates) or extrapulmonary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        639.5675048828125,
        511.01934814453125,
        652.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "samples (tissue samples, CSF or other body fluids) have not been adequately evaluated.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.0675048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        668.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        655.0675048828125,
        526.9654541015625,
        668.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "Culture and phenotypic DST plays a critical role in the monitoring of a patient’s response to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        670.5675048828125,
        516.9916381835938,
        683.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "treatment, and in detecting additional resistance to second-line drugs during treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.0675048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        699.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        686.0675048828125,
        527.013671875,
        699.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "SL-LPAs are suitable for use at the central or national reference laboratory level; they can",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        701.5675048828125,
        526.9533081054688,
        714.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "also be used at the regional level if the appropriate infrastructure can be ensured (three",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        717.0675048828125,
        230.17190551757812,
        730.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "separate rooms are required).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.5675048828125,
        78.81909942626953,
        745.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        732.5675048828125,
        526.6243286132812,
        745.7125244140625
      ],
      "text": "All patients identified by SL-LPAs should have access to appropriate treatment and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        748.0675048828125,
        190.64938354492188,
        761.2125244140625
      ],
      "text": "ancillary medications.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 91",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}